        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Inspected discussions have different framing: issue 7, \u201cquantizing model: undefined symbol: __cxa_call_terminate,\u201d reports an extension import failure; issue 15, \u201c`cogito-v1-preview-qwen-32B` generates incoherent output for bpw <= 2.5,\u201d concerns low-bitrate quantization; PR 4, \u201cchore: update config.py,\u201d proposes a spelling correction. None reports GLM4 execution.",
        "basis": "source",
